1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:02,520
(Sheldon:)Exactly.

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:06,260
(Amy:)Well, I wouldn't want you
to starve to death, so...

3
00:00:07,227 --> 00:00:09,597
(Amy:)...here's an eggplant.

4
00:00:11,431 --> 00:00:12,801
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

5
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:16,367
(Amy:)You know, some people
believe that Buridan

6
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:17,969
(Amy:)was plagiarizing Aristotle.

7
00:00:17,971 --> 00:00:19,501
(Sheldon:)Really?

8
00:00:19,506 --> 00:00:20,536
(Leonard:)Although,

9
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,810
(Amy:)in Aristotle's example,

10
00:00:21,808 --> 00:00:24,638
(Amy:)he proposed an equally
hungry and thirsty man

11
00:00:24,644 --> 00:00:26,074
(Amy:)caught between food and drink.

12
00:00:26,079 --> 00:00:27,809
(Sheldon:)Huh.

13
00:00:27,814 --> 00:00:29,084
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I wonder if that's related

14
00:00:29,082 --> 00:00:31,412
(Sheldon:)to the 12th century
Persian philosopher,

15
00:00:31,418 --> 00:00:32,318
(Sheldon:)Al-Ghazali

16
00:00:32,318 --> 00:00:33,888
(Sheldon:)and his story of a man

17
00:00:33,887 --> 00:00:35,587
(Sheldon:)caught between two dates.

18
00:00:35,588 --> 00:00:38,488
(Amy:)Are you suggesting Al-Ghazali
was Aristotelian?

19
00:00:38,491 --> 00:00:41,631
'Cause if anything,
he was anti-Aristotelian.

20
00:00:42,896 --> 00:00:46,196
(Amy:)Al-Ghazali was
anti-Aristotelian?

21
00:00:46,199 --> 00:00:48,069
(Sheldon:)Boy, you think you know a guy.

22
00:00:57,739 --> 00:00:59,039
(Leonard:)Okay.

23
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,980
(Penny:)Open your eyes and
see your new room.

24
00:01:06,014 --> 00:01:08,214
(Penny:)Wow.

25
00:01:09,217 --> 00:01:10,747
I-I know I went
a little overboard.

26
00:01:10,752 --> 00:01:11,982
(Penny:)We can always
dial it back.

27
00:01:11,987 --> 00:01:13,117
(Leonard:)No, no, no, no, no,

28
00:01:13,121 --> 00:01:14,021
it's-it's important to me

29
00:01:14,022 --> 00:01:15,752
(Leonard:)that you have
the bedroom you want.

30
00:01:15,757 --> 00:01:17,557
(Penny:)Oh, that means so
much. I love you.

31
00:01:17,559 --> 00:01:19,129
(Leonard:)I love you, too.

32
00:01:22,264 --> 00:01:55,724
(Leonard:)Just hiding some stuff in
your closet, don't tell Penny.

